{"id":"feec16aff2b8fbf5","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-wreath-product.md","title":"Wreath Product","display":"df-wreath-product — Wreath Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-wreath-product","aliases":["58-df-wreath-product"],"display":"df-wreath-product — Wreath Product","depends_on":["[[58-df-group]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-wreath-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-wreath-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-wreath-product — Wreath Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\cdot_G,H,\\cdot_H,e_H,\\iota_H,X,\\rho,W,\\star\\in V\">\\(G,\\cdot_G,H,\\cdot_H,e_H,\\iota_H,X,\\rho,W,\\star\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_H\\in H\">\\(e_H\\in H\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Action}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Action}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (action predicate defined here) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WreathProduct}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{WreathProduct}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wreath\\text{-}product\\text{-}action}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Action}_S(\\rho,H,\\cdot_H,X)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,H\\times X,X)\n\\land\\exists e\\in H\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall h\\in H\\;(e\\cdot_Hh=h=h\\cdot_He)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\rho(e,x)=x)\n\\land\\forall h_1,h_2\\in H\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\rho(h_1\\cdot_Hh_2,x)=\\rho(h_1,\\rho(h_2,x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wreath\\text{-}product\\text{-}action}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Action}_S(\\rho,H,\\cdot_H,X)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,H\\times X,X)\n\\land\\exists e\\in H\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall h\\in H\\;(e\\cdot_Hh=h=h\\cdot_He)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\rho(e,x)=x)\n\\land\\forall h_1,h_2\\in H\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\rho(h_1\\cdot_Hh_2,x)=\\rho(h_1,\\rho(h_2,x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wreath\\text{-}product}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WreathProduct}_S(W,\\star,G,\\cdot_G,H,\\cdot_H,e_H,\\iota_H,X,\\rho)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Action}_S(\\rho,H,\\cdot_H,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land e_H\\in H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;(e_H\\cdot_Hh=h=h\\cdot_He_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota_H,H,H)\n\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;(h\\cdot_H\\iota_H(h)=e_H=\\iota_H(h)\\cdot_Hh)\\\\\n&amp;\\land W=\\{g\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,G)\\}\\times H\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,W\\times W,W)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall g,g&#39;\\in\\{q\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(q,X,G)\\}\\;\\forall h,h&#39;\\in H\\;\n\\exists k\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(k,X,G)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\nk(x)=g(x)\\cdot_Gg&#39;(\\rho(\\iota_H(h),x))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14em}\\land\n\\star(\\langle\\langle g,h\\rangle,\\langle g&#39;,h&#39;\\rangle\\rangle)\n=\\langle k,h\\cdot_Hh&#39;\\rangle\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wreath\\text{-}product}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WreathProduct}_S(W,\\star,G,\\cdot_G,H,\\cdot_H,e_H,\\iota_H,X,\\rho)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Action}_S(\\rho,H,\\cdot_H,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land e_H\\in H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;(e_H\\cdot_Hh=h=h\\cdot_He_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota_H,H,H)\n\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;(h\\cdot_H\\iota_H(h)=e_H=\\iota_H(h)\\cdot_Hh)\\\\\n&amp;\\land W=\\{g\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,G)\\}\\times H\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,W\\times W,W)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall g,g&#39;\\in\\{q\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(q,X,G)\\}\\;\\forall h,h&#39;\\in H\\;\n\\exists k\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(k,X,G)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\nk(x)=g(x)\\cdot_Gg&#39;(\\rho(\\iota_H(h),x))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{14em}\\land\n\\star(\\langle\\langle g,h\\rangle,\\langle g&#39;,h&#39;\\rangle\\rangle)\n=\\langle k,h\\cdot_Hh&#39;\\rangle\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Wreath product: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\wr H\">\\(G \\wr H\\)</span> encodes group actions on product sets.</li>\n<li>Example: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_p \\wr C_n = (C_p)^n \\rtimes C_n\">\\(C_p \\wr C_n = (C_p)^n \\rtimes C_n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Frobenius groups: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F = N \\rtimes H\">\\(F = N \\rtimes H\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> acting irreducibly.</li>\n<li>Primitive groups: wreath products and almost simple groups.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)$ and $\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)$ (see [[58-df-group]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,\\cdot_G,H,\\cdot_H,e_H,\\iota_H,X,\\rho,W,\\star\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"e_H\\in H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Action}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WreathProduct}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wreath\\text{-}product\\text{-}action}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Action}_S(\\rho,H,\\cdot_H,X)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,H\\times X,X)\n\\land\\exists e\\in H\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall h\\in H\\;(e\\cdot_Hh=h=h\\cdot_He)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\rho(e,x)=x)\n\\land\\forall h_1,h_2\\in H\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\n\\rho(h_1\\cdot_Hh_2,x)=\\rho(h_1,\\rho(h_2,x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}wreath\\text{-}product}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{WreathProduct}_S(W,\\star,G,\\cdot_G,H,\\cdot_H,e_H,\\iota_H,X,\\rho)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(H,\\cdot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Action}_S(\\rho,H,\\cdot_H,X)\\\\\n&\\land e_H\\in H\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;(e_H\\cdot_Hh=h=h\\cdot_He_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota_H,H,H)\n\\land\\forall h\\in H\\;(h\\cdot_H\\iota_H(h)=e_H=\\iota_H(h)\\cdot_Hh)\\\\\n&\\land W=\\{g\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,G)\\}\\times H\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\star,W\\times W,W)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall g,g'\\in\\{q\\in V:\\mathrm{Function}(q,X,G)\\}\\;\\forall h,h'\\in H\\;\n\\exists k\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(k,X,G)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\nk(x)=g(x)\\cdot_Gg'(\\rho(\\iota_H(h),x))\\\\\n&\\hspace{14em}\\land\n\\star(\\langle\\langle g,h\\rangle,\\langle g',h'\\rangle\\rangle)\n=\\langle k,h\\cdot_Hh'\\rangle\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"G \\wr H","display":false},{"tex":"C_p \\wr C_n = (C_p)^n \\rtimes C_n","display":false},{"tex":"F = N \\rtimes H","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false}],"bytes":2149,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1398","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-wreath-product.md|58-df-wreath-product]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["ed71f39f59370734","36d7463d215be751"]}